<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 58 0 R
/T (Virgin Active is one of the leading health and fitness organisations in South Africa, offering modern gym facilities, group exercise classes, personal training, wellness programmes, and digital fitness services. The company aims to inspire people to live active and healthy lifestyles by providing high-quality fitness experiences. Virgin Active serves a wide range of customers, including students, working professionals, families, and senior citizens. The organisation is committed to improving the health and well-being of its members through innovation and excellent customer service \(Virgin Active, 2025a\).)
/E (Virgin Active is one of the leading health and fitness organisations in South Africa, offering modern gym facilities, group exercise classes, personal training, wellness programmes, and digital fitness services. The company aims to inspire people to live active and healthy lifestyles by providing high-quality fitness experiences. Virgin Active serves a wide range of customers, including students, working professionals, families, and senior citizens. The organisation is committed to improving the health and well-being of its members through innovation and excellent customer service \(Virgin Active, 2025a\).)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
