/T (The main goal of the proposed website is to improve the digital experience for current and potential members. The website aims to increase online membership registrations, simplify class bookings, provide fitness information, and improve customer support. Key Performance Indicators \(KPIs\) will include increased website traffic, more online membership sign-ups, higher class booking rates, improved customer satisfaction, and lower website bounce rates \(Virgin Active, 2025b\).)
